Z||000004||TwisT||03-20-2001||09:45 AM||||Guys,  this is Gabriel Cayetano's old ride.  It was originally an '88 Formula.  He completely went through the car and converted it to fastback.  Also,  that rear wing was an Eclipse unit which was fabricated to fit,  then molded to the car.  Those are 17" OZ's for wheels.<P>Gabriel didn't quite get to the paint when he was basically forced to sell this nice Fiero.  Shame,  very nice work indeed.<P>Why we got to rice-bash?  It has an Eclipse wing,  big deal.  Not GReddy stickers and cantelope tips.  Gabe is a great guy,  and the rice thing is old people.<P>Brett  ||||reg||1
